      "description": "Describe a scene and get video with synchronised audio. This is OliviaRossi's Hybrid DMAD PDMD: a merge of MiniMax H3's two base models, FL2VA for the look and Ref2VA for following references, with the DMAD and PDMD distillations built in. There is no LoRA to load and nothing extra to install.\n\nThe picture is bright and crisp with a lot of fine background detail. Beside the DaSiWa GXS v5 pack on the same prompts it is the lighter and more detailed of the two.\n\nEight steps by default, the author's setting: about 90 to 115 s per five-second shot at 480p on a 12 GB card with Faster Attention on. The slider goes from four, the author's fast preview (about 50 s), to ten for maximum detail (about 25 s more than eight).\n\nA scripted line came out word for word on three of three seeds.\n\nDownloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed.\n\nModel format: int8 ConvRot.",
