          "sizeGB": 40,
          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets (18.9 GB, from Hugging Face, no key). Eight steps by default, euler/simple, sigma shift 12.0 video / 3.0 audio, no CFG: the author's settings. The distillation is baked in, so there is no Turbo LoRA. The author's step guidance: 4 fast preview, 6 to 8 best quality, 10 maximum detail; the slider covers 4 to 10. MEASURED 2026-11-12 (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 5 s, engine 0.45.0, faster attention on): through the app, 88-113 s per text-to-video shot at eight steps (two runs), 51 s at four, 68 s at six and 112 s at ten; 91-109 s per image-to-video shot and 92-110 s per reference shot at eight steps. The second run of each card started with less free RAM (about 5 GB against 10) and was the slower one. Engine-direct, eight steps took 84-121 s over 24 clips. Spectrum step-skipping is deliberately NOT enabled: it garbled a spoken line on other distilled H3 checkpoints. The author also publishes a smaller W6A8 file (14.8 GB); this pack uses the int8 file and the W6A8 file is untested here."
